# Exemplos de todas as rotas da API (extensão REST Client do VS Code).
# Suba a API antes:  make api
#
# Rotas escritas no código (app/api.py):  GET /health  e  POST /chat
# Rotas que o FastAPI gera sozinho:       GET /docs, /redoc, /openapi.json

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

############################################################
# GET /health
############################################################

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

############################################################
# POST /chat
############################################################

### Chat: question with an answer
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Qual é o SLA para incidentes P1 no plano Enterprise?"
}

### Chat: with debug (query plan, retrieved chunks, selected chunks)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Qual é o SLA para incidentes P1 no plano Enterprise?",
  "debug": true
}

### Chat: without reranking
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Quais formas de pagamento o FCAI Cloud aceita?",
  "use_rerank": false,
  "debug": true
}

### Chat: no plan named (answer covers the three plans)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "O que acontece se eu ultrapassar a cota de ingestão?"
}

### Chat: ambiguous question (returns needs_clarification=true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Como funciona o suporte no plano da empresa?"
}

### Chat: answer not in the knowledge base (returns has_answer=false)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Qual é a capital da França?"
}

### Chat: empty question (returns 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "   "
}

### Chat: missing "question" field (returns 422, validation by FastAPI)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "debug": true
}

############################################################
# Rotas geradas pelo FastAPI (documentação interativa)
############################################################

### Swagger UI (abra no navegador)
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs

### ReDoc (abra no navegador)
GET {{baseUrl}}/redoc

### OpenAPI schema (JSON)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json
